        comparison_points: ['The August Offer accepted the principle, while the Cabinet Mission Plan supplied the operational method.', 'A Constituent Assembly makes a Constitution; a legislature primarily makes ordinary laws, although the Indian Assembly performed both functions during the transition.'],
