        common_misconceptions: ['The Council can permanently block every Assembly Bill.', 'A State bicameral legislature uses a joint sitting like Parliament.'],
        exam_focus_points: ['Revise the two-stage Council delay rule conceptually.', 'Remember no joint sitting for State Houses.', 'Distinguish Articles 200 and 201.']
