      { movement: 'Constitutional exceptions: Articles 243M and 243ZC', period: 'Special areas', leaders: 'Scheduled, tribal and special areas', key_points: 'Part IX and Part IXA contain exceptions for specified Scheduled and tribal areas, certain North-Eastern States and other constitutionally protected arrangements.' }
