        key_points: ['Western disturbances - winter northwest rain', 'Loo - hot dry northern wind', 'Mango showers - south pre-monsoon rain', 'Nor\'westers - eastern thunderstorms', 'Bay cyclones - pre- and post-monsoon risk.'],
